<title>USA: Mass. $700 mln GO bonds priced, 5.55 pct top yield.</title>
<headline>Mass. $700 mln GO bonds priced, 5.55 pct top yield.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it tentatively priced $700 million of Massachusetts new money and refunding bonds, with a top yield of 5.55 percent.</p>
<p>Portions of the refunding bond issue were insured by MBIA, AMBAC and FGIC. Portions of the new money issue were insured by AMBAC.  </p>
